--- machine\system\network\rules\<layer>\<rule...> time.second.<op>
canonical: Machine\System\Network\Rules\<Layer>\<rule...> Time.Second.<op>
type: REG_DWORD, REG_QWORD, a decimal string, or a REG_MULTI_SZ list
default: (absent — the rule does not condition on this fact)
valid: Equal, GreaterThan, LessThan, Present; 0-59
applies: live — at the next generation

