--- machine\system\network\rules\<layer>\<rule...> start.year.<op>
canonical: Machine\System\Network\Rules\<Layer>\<rule...> Start.Year.<op>
type: REG_DWORD, REG_QWORD, a decimal string, or a REG_MULTI_SZ list
default: (absent — the rule does not condition on this fact)
valid: Equal, GreaterThan, LessThan, Present; a year
applies: live — at the next generation

The year of the wall clock when the flow began, UTC.

The `Flow` layer only. Fixed for the flow's life, so unlike `Time.*` it
never expires a sentence.

