--- machine\system\network\rules\<layer>\<rule...> interface.kind.<op>
canonical: Machine\System\Network\Rules\<Layer>\<rule...> Interface.Kind.<op>
type: REG_SZ, or a REG_MULTI_SZ list meaning any of
