applies: live — at the next generation

The interface's stable id -- its key name under `Interfaces\`.

Derived from bus path and hardware address, so it survives a rename and
a reboot. The `Interface` layer only, where it is always present.

--- machine\system\network\rules\<layer>\<rule...> interface.mac.<op>
